The 3 'gifts' you can get from a priestess are (almost) mutually exclusive:

200 - 400 = Clairvoyance  ("Thou art indeed a pious individual. I bestow
			     upon thee a blessing")
    You can get alignment increase at the same time that you get
    clairvoyance if your alignment is really bad.

400 - 600 = Protection	 ("Thy devotion has been rewarded.")

> 600 =   Cleanse/alignment increase ("Thy selfless generosity is
				       deeply appreciated.")


Also, if you give 0 gold to a co-aligned priestess, you lose alignment.
("Thou shalt regret thine action!")



